[Output files]
- CfgChrono_Scheme.vtk.........: Saves VTK file with scheme of Chrono objects and links between objects.
- CfgInit_Domain.vtk...........: Saves the limits of the case and the simulation domain limits.
- CfgInit_MapCells.vtk.........: Saves the cell division of the simulation domain.
- ChronoBody_forces.csv........: Saves forces for each body.
- ChronoExchange_mkbound_XX.csv: Saves information of data exchange between DualSPHysics and Chrono library for each body.
- ChronoLink_forces.csv........: Saves forces for each link.
- FloatingAce_mkbound_XX.csv...: Saves information of acceleration used to move the floating object.
- Run.csv......................: One line CSV file with execution parameters and other simulation data.
- Run.out......................: Log file of the simulation.
- RunPARTs.csv.................: Saves extra information of simulated PARTs.
- chrono_objs/XXXX_mkXXXX.obj..: Geometry files used for Chrono interaction.
- data/PartFloatInfo.ibi4......: Main binary file with floating data during simulation.
- data/PartFloatInfo2.ibi4.....: Extra binary file with floating data during simulation.
- data/PartInfo.ibi4...........: Binary file with execution information for each instant (input for PartInfo program).
- data/PartMotionRef.ibi4......: Main binary file with motion reference data of moving and floating objects during simulation.
- data/PartMotionRef2.ibi4.....: Extra binary file with motion reference data of moving and floating objects during simulation.
- data/PartOut_???.obi4........: Binary file with particles excluded during simulation (input for PartVtkOut program).
- data/Part_????.bi4...........: Binary file with particle data in different instants.
- data/Part_Head.ibi4..........: Binary file with basic information of simulation data.
 
